  "claim_scope": "An exact eight-site nonlinear model organism proves that clean-point first-order attribution can miss saturated Q/K sites and an exactly cancelling source. The AtP* Q/K softmax correction and GradDrop recover the exact toy ranking. A pinned Pythia-70M study over 24 grammar pairs compares exact patching, vanilla AtP, AtP*, same-size random circuits, clean-pair shuffling, and label shuffling across 96 named final-position Q/K sites. The distinct EAP-style baseline is toy-only. This is component-level ranking evidence, not a complete circuit interpretation.",
